m in itself.","kind":"contaminant","name":"Revised Total Coliform Rule"},"LEAD AND COPPER RULE REVISIONS":{"kind":"rule","name":"LEAD AND COPPER RULE REVISIONS","plain":"A requirement about how a system must monitor for lead and copper, inventory its service lines, and act when results are high. A violation here is usually a failure to do the required work on schedule rather than a measured exceedance.","effect":null,"source":null,"who":null},"Lead and Copper Rule":{"kind":"rule","name":"Lead and Copper Rule","plain":"The rule governing lead and copper monitoring and corrosion control. A violation is often procedural \u2014 a missed sampling round or a late report.","effect":null,"source":null,"who":null}}}